Source: sqlite-fdw
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Taiga Katayama <https://github.com/t-kataym>
Build-Depends:
 libsqlite3-dev,
 postgresql-server-dev-all (>= 217~),
 make,
 gcc
Standards-Version: 4.6.1
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/pgspider/sqlite_fdw.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/pgspider/sqlite_fdw
Homepage: https://github.com/pgspider/sqlite_fdw

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-sqlite-fdw
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, postgresql-PGVERSION
Description: SQLite Foreign data wrapper for PostgreSQL
 sqlite_fdw access to SQLite data from PostgreSQL with bidirectional data 
 transport and some pushed to SQLite queries.
